 "chapter_outcomes": [
  "Elementary probability.",
  "Sample space. Exclusive and complementary events. Conditional probability. Understanding and use of P(A′) = 1 − P(A), P(A ∪ B) = P(A) + P(B) − P(A ∩ B), P(A ∩ B) = P(A) P(B |A).",
  "Independence of two events. P(B | A) = P(B), P(A | B) = P(A), P(A ∩ B) = P(A) P(B).",
  "Sum and product laws. Use of tree diagrams and Venn diagrams. Sampling with and without replacement."
